from (values
  ($v$amaco$v$, $v$potters-choice$v$, $v$PC-01$v$, $v$Saturation Metallic$v$, $v$amaco-saturation-metallic$v$, $v$glaze$v$, $v$Great for sculptural work and industrial ware, Saturation Metallic is a satin metallic black glaze that resembles steel and other metals$v$, $v$#494d4d$v$, $v$black$v$, array[$v$black$v$]::text[], $v$metallic$v$, null, 5, 6, null, $v$Great for sculptural work and industrial ware, Saturation Metallic is a satin metallic black glaze that resembles steel and other metals. Saturation Metallic is great as an accent glaze.$v$, $v$https://shop.amaco.com/pc-01-saturation-metallic/$v$, $v$AMACO: optimal results at Cone 5/6 (Cone 5 = 1186 °C, Cone 6 = 1222 °C). Apply to bisqueware fired to Cone 04 (1063 °C). Source: https://shop.amaco.com/glazes-underglazes/high-fire-glazes/pc-potters-choice/$v$, null, null, $v$https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-a0h9fhqogk/products/458/images/2685/PC-1_6x6_Label_Tile_Chip-hires__86175.1659533154.386.513.jpg?c=1$v$, $v$AMACO$v$),
  ($v$amaco$v$, $v$potters-choice$v$, $v$PC-02$v$, $v$Saturation Gold$v$, $v$amaco-saturation-gold$v$, $v$glaze$v$, $v$Saturation Gold has a smooth, satin/matte finish that is a dark gold similar to bronze when fired$v$, $v$#b69558$v$, $v$gold$v$, array[$v$gold$v$,$v$bronze$v$]::text[], $v$metallic$v$, null, 5, 6, null, $v$Saturation Gold has a smooth, satin/matte finish that is a dark gold similar to bronze when fired. Perfect for sculptural work and industrial ware, this glaze could be a unique accent for any work of art. Saturation Gold requires a heavy application to develop its gold metallic finish.$v$, $v$https://shop.amaco.com/pc-02-saturation-gold/$v$, $v$AMACO: optimal results at Cone 5/6 (Cone 5 = 1186 °C, Cone 6 = 1222 °C). Apply to bisqueware fired to Cone 04 (1063 °C). Source: https://shop.amaco.com/glazes-underglazes/high-fire-glazes/pc-potters-choice/$v$, null, null, $v$https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-a0h9fhqogk/products/460/images/2680/PC-2_6x6_Label_Tile_Chip-hires__96178.1659532908.386.513.jpg?c=1$v$, $v$AMACO$v$),
  ($v$amaco$v$, $v$potters-choice$v$, $v$PC-04$v$, $v$Palladium$v$, $v$amaco-palladium$v$, $v$glaze$v$, $v$This unique metallic glaze has a mirrorlike finish when fired and adds beautiful, shimmering accents to any work$v$, $v$#c3b595$v$, null, '{}'::text[], $v$metallic$v$, null, 5, 6, null, $v$This unique metallic glaze has a mirrorlike finish when fired and adds beautiful, shimmering accents to any work. Because it is not food safe, this glaze is perfect for sculptural work that calls for reflective, glassy surfaces. Palladium requires 3 coats to develop the smooth mirror finish.  This glaze is fluid so be careful not to overfire. This glaze likes low porosity bodies. It is also great as an accent glaze or for layering with other AMACO glazes.$v$, $v$https://shop.amaco.com/pc-04-palladium/$v$, $v$AMACO: optimal results at Cone 5/6 (Cone 5 = 1186 °C, Cone 6 = 1222 °C). Apply to bisqueware fired to Cone 04 (1063 °C). Source: https://shop.amaco.com/glazes-underglazes/high-fire-glazes/pc-potters-choice/$v$, null, null, $v$https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-a0h9fhqogk/products/476/images/2646/PC-4_6x6_Label_Tile_Chip-hires__03947.1659465701.386.513.jpg?c=1$v$, $v$AMACO$v$),
